<title>UK: TABLE-Plysu year profits jump by 35 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Plysu year profits jump by 35 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 12.5		  vs   9.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   5.75		 vs   5.35</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   7.75		 vs   7.35</p>
<p> Pretax			 9.3		  vs   6.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   134.1		  vs 129.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Pretax profit in 1995/96 stated after exceptional costs of 1.1 million stg relating to integration of BlowMocan's industrial containers division; comparison if exceptional item for previous year excluded show 1996/97 pretax profit up 16 percent.</p>
<p>Plysu said in a statement it had acquired Spanish bottle manufacturer Iplast SA for 4.25 million stg.</p>
<p>Full name of plastics manufacturer - Plysu Plc</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
</text>
